Package: linux-resource-monitor
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), coreutils, procps
Maintainer: moolean <moolean@example.com>
Description: A top-like Linux resource monitoring tool
 Linux Resource Monitor is a system monitoring tool similar to 'top' that
 provides real-time monitoring of system resources.
 .
 Features:
  - Real-time CPU and memory monitoring
  - Shows top 10 processes by resource usage
  - Displays detailed information including user, PID, and command
  - Automatic real-time updates similar to 'top' command
  - Support for user aggregation mode
  - Simple keyboard controls
 .
 The package includes both a high-performance shell script version and
 a Python version with enhanced features.
